"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan-ws2602668","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p095","quote":"　　二年春三月，遣使者羊衜、鄭冑、將軍孫怡之遼東。擊魏守將張持、髙慮等，虜得男女。零陵言甘露降。夏五月，城沙羨。冬十月，將軍蔣秘南討夷賊。秘所領都督廖式殺臨賀太守嚴綱等，自稱平南將軍，與弟潛共攻零陵、桂陽，及搖動交州蒼梧、鬱林諸都，眾數萬人。遣將軍呂岱、唐咨討之，歳餘皆破。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p095:m0094","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p095:m0074"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段主語及稱謂錄親屬原詞。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-wu060-lvdai6","person_id":"gi6_ov3_5wd","event_type":"death","source_term":"斬式及遣諸所偽署臨賀太守費楊等","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-060","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-060-lvdai","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line057","quote":"　　潘濬卒，岱代浚領荊州文書，與陸遜井在武昌，故督蒲圻。頃之，廖式作亂。攻圍城邑，零陵、蒼梧、鬱林諸郡騷擾，岱自表輒行，星夜兼路。權遣使追拜岱交州牧，及遣諸將唐咨等駱驛相繼，攻討一年破之，斬式及遣諸所偽署臨賀太守費楊等，並其支黨，郡縣悉平，復還武昌。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line057:m0031"}],"interpretation_note":"本來源所記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p095:m0074","surface":"廖式","start":74,"end":76,"kind":"person","person_id":"gi6_ov3_5wd","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p095","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line057:m0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"廖式","kind":"person","person_id":"gi6_ov3_5wd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line057","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-lvdai:line057:m0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"式","kind":"person","person_id":"gi6_ov3_5wd","status":"contextual_